	(text "HEADPHONE OUTPUT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.56 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "134724f4-3f1c-4af4-a0e3-a8cde2f06337")
	)
	(text "U2 EN is tied to +5V: the headphone amp is on whenever +5V is up. A hung Daisy is muted by the codec,\nnot by U2. The firmware feeds the STM32 internal watchdog (IWDG) only from the audio callback: if audio stops,\nthe STM32 resets, its clocks stop, and the TAC5242 powers down its DAC (both outputs). Its pins float,\nand R37 holds SPK_EN low (Q4 off, speaker amp muted). The speaker amp mute is SPK_MUTE on J3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.56 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "22844f4b-81fb-4fb8-ad39-52909926a6e5")
	)
	(text "HEADPHONE FILTER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "24450a35-782f-4873-87e3-2f1e98f846b7")
	)
	(text "DAISY SEED"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175.26 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2f9e93f4-8c14-47c7-9c34-3080e57850d8")
	)
	(text "Op-amp power rails"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 34.29 126.746 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "34fc5d1d-bbdf-4e05-a1bd-4706e7db4ce6")
	)
	(text "AUDIO INPUT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "39e876eb-d8b3-467b-934d-ddeafe9ee5c2")
	)
	(text "Headphone detect: J5 pins 5-6 are an isolated N-O switch\nthat closes on plug insertion, so HP_DETECT is LOW with\nheadphones in. No external pull-up: the firmware enables\nPG9's internal pull-up, so the line floats until it runs.\nBring-up: short TP11 to GND to simulate it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.56 138.43 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3ba938b3-b47c-4b86-952a-c2cfcb21c716")
	)
	(text "SPEAKER / LINE SEND, AUX INPUT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 187.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "440b5765-5589-46b4-8069-e1dafe2be3e1")
	)
	(text "OUTPUT MUTE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.56 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "48377894-3736-41bc-a476-8ea0881d7196")
	)
	(text "Q1: reverse-polarity protection for 5V_IN (J3)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 52.324 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "61445f20-03e0-4f89-9622-10580c4e81e6")
	)
	(text "Mono to both ears / 16-64 ohm headphones"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.56 21.844 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "68a60ad7-064d-4b8c-b236-c18118f228be")
	)
	(text "DISPLAY"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.68 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "82c632f3-7ae7-45d0-acdc-fc6fdb2fbed2")
	)
	(text "U2: TPA6132A2 DirectPath, gain 0 dB (G0 high, G1 low). Outputs sit at 0 V: no output caps.\nC12/C13 with the 19.8k internal input R: 1.7 Hz high-pass. EN tied to +5V (always on).\nLayout: run SGND straight to the J5 sleeve pin. HPVDD/HPVSS are made inside U2: caps only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 291.08 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9667a2ff-b0a1-4170-8d5d-8b055b0aef20")
	)
	(text "AUDIO_OUT_2 feeds J2 and the speaker amp (J8) directly.\nHP_DETECT mutes the speaker amp (SPK_EN); J2 stays live."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 118.11 232.41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9fd55915-013b-483c-9d60-acdcbfa75931")
	)
	(text "R17 = 1M guitar input load. No input level pot: trim gain in firmware."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 62.23 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a78301e2-107b-4973-928e-941a1b4d216a")
	)
	(text "POWER & BIAS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a9c86a61-e146-44a9-9a21-52d439089c5c")
	)
	(text "J3 goes to the power board (JST-XH, 8 pins). Pins 5-7 are 3.3 V logic: nothing above 3.3 V on them.\nSPK_MUTE is open drain. The power board pulls it up, so the speaker amp stays muted unless SPK_EN is high."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 284.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b4f7dbd4-6681-447c-abe3-b1391231b6e1")
	)
	(text "POWER BOARD CONNECTOR"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 243.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b6e62c11-ddd3-46b0-a9cf-36c036ed74c3")
	)
